msgid "Spin-orbit-coupling"
msgstr "自旋-轨道耦合"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"Spin-orbit matrix elements and eigenstates can be computed using either the "
"Breit-Pauli (BP) operator or spin-orbit pseudopotentials (ECPs). The *state-"
"interacting* method is employed, which means that the spin-orbit eigenstates"
" are obtained by diagonalizing :math:`\\hat H_{el} + \\hat H_{SO}` in a "
"basis of eigenfunctions of :math:`\\hat H_{el}`. The full Breit-Pauli SO-"
"operator can be used only for MCSCF wavefunctions. For MRCI wavefunctions, "
"the full BP operator is used for computing the matrix elements between "
"*internal configurations* (no electrons in external orbitals), while for "
"contributions of external configurations a mean-field one-electron fock "
"operator is employed. The error caused by this approximation is usually "
"smaller than 1 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`."
msgstr ""
"自旋-轨道矩阵元和本征态可以使用 Breit-Pauli (BP) 算符或自旋-轨道赝势 (ECPs) 进行计算。采用\\ *态相互作用*\\ "
"方法，这意味着自旋-轨道本征态是通过在 :math:`\\hat H_{el}` 的本征函数基组中对角化 :math:`\\hat H_{el} + "
"\\hat H_{SO}` 获得的。完整的 Breit-Pauli SO 算符仅能用于 MCSCF 波函数。对于 MRCI 波函数，完整的 BP "
"算符用于计算\\ *内部组态*\\ （外部轨道中没有电子）之间的矩阵元，而对于外禀组态的贡献，则采用平均场单电子 Fock "
"算符。此近似引起的误差通常小于 1 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"The program allows either the computation of individual spin-orbit matrix "
"elements for a given pair of states, or the automatic setting-up and "
"diagonalization of the whole matrix for a given set of electronic states. In"
" the latter case, matrix elements over one-electron operators are also "
"computed and transformed to the spin-orbit eigenstates (by default, the "
"dipole matrix elements are computed; other operators can be specified on the"
" ``GEXPEC`` or ``EXPEC`` cards, see section `One-electron operators and "
"expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-"
"and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__). Since it may be often sufficient to "
"compute the spin-orbit matrix elements in a smaller basis than the energies,"
" it is possible to replace the energy eigenvalues by precomputed values, "
"which are passed to the spin-orbit program by the ``MOLPRO`` variable "
"``HLSDIAG``."
msgstr ""
"该程序允许计算给定一对态的单个自旋-"
"轨道矩阵元，或者为给定的一组电子态自动建立并对角化整个矩阵。在后一种情况下，还会计算单电子算符上的矩阵元并将其变换到自旋-"
"轨道本征态（默认情况下计算偶极矩阵元；其他算符可以在 ``GEXPEC`` 或 ``EXPEC`` 卡片上指定，参见章节 `单电子算符和期望值 "
"(GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-"
"values-gexpec>`__\\ ）。由于通常在一个比能量计算更小的基组中计算自旋-"
"轨道矩阵元可能就足够了，因此可以用预先计算的值替换能量本征值，这些值通过 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 ``HLSDIAG`` 传递给自旋-轨道程序。"

msgid "Calculation of SO integrals"
msgstr "SO 积分计算"

msgid ""
"The one-and two-electron spin-orbit integrals over the BP Hamiltonian can be"
" precomputed and stored on disk using the command"
msgstr "BP 哈密顿量上的单电子和双电子自旋-轨道积分可以使用以下命令预先计算并存储在磁盘上"

msgid "Calculation of individual SO matrix elements"
msgstr "单个SO矩阵元的计算"

msgid ""
"Individual spin-orbit matrix elements can be computed within the MRCI "
"program using"
msgstr "可以在MRCI程序中使用以下方式计算单个自旋-轨道矩阵元："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"Since the spin-orbit program is part of the MRCI program, the ``TRANLS`` "
"card must be preceded by a ``[MR]CI`` card.  If in the MRCI step several "
"states of the same symmetry are computed simultaneously using the ``STATE`` "
"directive, the matrix elements are computed for all these states. Note that "
"the ``OCC`` and ``CLOSED`` cards must be the same for all states used in a "
"``TRANLS`` calculation. ``TRANLS`` can also be used with records saved by "
"the ``MULTI`` program (e.g. ``multi,cisave=record1.file``)."
msgstr ""
"由于自旋轨道程序是MRCI程序的一部分，\\ ``TRANLS`` 卡片前必须有一个 ``[MR]CI`` 卡片。如果在MRCI步骤中使用 "
"``STATE`` 指令同时计算了多个相同对称性的态，则矩阵元会为所有这些态计算。请注意，在 ``TRANLS`` 计算中使用的所有态，其 "
"``OCC`` 和 ``CLOSED`` 卡片必须相同。\\ ``TRANLS`` 也可以与 ``MULTI`` 程序保存的记录一起使用（例如 "
"``multi,cisave=record1.file``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"The selection rules for the :math:`M_S` values are :math:`\\Delta M_S = \\pm"
" 1` for the ``LSX`` and ``LSY`` operators, and :math:`\\Delta M_S=0` for the"
" ``LSZ`` operator. Note that :math:`2M_S` has to be specified, and so the "
"selection rules applying to the difference of the input values are 0 or 2."
msgstr ""
":math:`M_S` 值的选择定则为：对于 ``LSX`` 和 ``LSY`` 算符，\\ :math:`\\Delta M_S = \\pm "
"1`\\ ；对于 ``LSZ`` 算符，\\ :math:`\\Delta M_S=0`\\ 。请注意，必须指定 :math:`2M_S`\\ "
"，因此适用于输入值差值的选择定则为 0 或 2。"

msgid ""
"In all-electron SO calculations the value of the calculated spin-orbit "
"matrix element is saved (in atomic units) in the ``MOLPRO`` variables "
"``TRLSX``, ``TRLSY`` and ``TRLSZ`` for the :math:`x`, :math:`y`, and "
":math:`z` components respectively. For ECP-LS calculations the variables "
"``TRECPLSX``, ``TRECPLSY``, and ``TRECPLSZ`` are used. Note that for "
"imaginary matrix elements (i.e., for the :math:`x` and :math:`z` components "
"of the SO Hamiltonian) the matrix elements are imaginary and the stored real"
" values have to be multiplied by :math:`i`. If matrix elements for several "
"states are computed, all values are stored in the respective variable-arrays"
" with the bra-states running fastest."
msgstr ""
"在全电子SO计算中，计算出的自旋-轨道矩阵元的值（以原子单位计）分别保存在 ``MOLPRO`` 变量 ``TRLSX``\\ 、\\ "
"``TRLSY`` 和 ``TRLSZ`` 中，对应 :math:`x`\\ 、\\ :math:`y` 和 :math:`z` 分量。对于ECP-"
"LS计算，则使用变量 ``TRECPLSX``\\ 、\\ ``TRECPLSY`` 和 ``TRECPLSZ``\\ "
"。请注意，对于虚数矩阵元（即SO哈密顿量的 :math:`x` 和 :math:`z` 分量），矩阵元是虚数，存储的实数值需要乘以 "
":math:`i`\\ 。如果计算了多个态的矩阵元，所有值都存储在相应的变量数组中，其中左矢态变化最快。"

msgid ""
"Approximations used in calculating spin-orbit integrals and matrix elements"
msgstr "计算自旋-轨道积分和矩阵元时使用的近似"

msgid ""
"Recently, more sophisticated approximations were introduced to simplify "
"spin-orbit calculations for larger molecules. These are controlled by "
"specifying the spin-orbit operator type *lsop* as follows (we omit suffixes "
"``X, Y, Z`` which specify the component):"
msgstr ""
"最近，引入了更复杂的近似来简化较大分子的自旋轨道计算。这些通过如下指定自旋轨道算符类型 *lsop* 来控制（我们省略了指定分量的后缀 ``X, Y, "
"Z``\\ ）："

msgid "``LS`` Standard spin-orbit calculations."
msgstr "``LS`` 标准自旋轨道计算。"

msgid ""
"``ALS`` The one-center approximation is used for one- and two-electron spin-"
"orbit integrals."
msgstr "``ALS`` 对单电子和双电子自旋-轨道积分使用单中心近似。"

msgid ""
"``FLS`` The effective Fock-matrix approximation is used for the internal "
"part too."
msgstr "``FLS`` 对内部部分也使用有效的 Fock 矩阵近似。"

msgid ""
"``AFLS|AMFI`` The one-center approximation is used for one- and two-electron"
" spin-orbit integrals, and the effective Fock-matrix approximation for the "
"internal part."
msgstr "``AFLS|AMFI`` 对单电子和双电子自旋-轨道积分使用单中心近似，并对内部部分使用有效的 Fock 矩阵近似。"

msgid ""
"``ECPLS`` Effective core potentials are used for all atoms at which they are"
" defined; contributions of all other atoms are neglected (see below)."
msgstr "``ECPLS`` 对所有定义了有效芯势的原子使用有效芯势；忽略所有其他原子的贡献（见下文）。"

msgid ""
"In case that the effective Fock matrix is used for all contributions, and no"
" spin-orbit integrals are pre-calculated and stored on disk (i.e., the "
"``LSINT`` command is not given), the Fock matrices are evaluated in direct "
"mode and no integrals are stored on disk. When this is combined with the "
"one-center approximation (AMFI), the computing and I/O times are drastically"
" reduced, and this makes spin-orbit calculations quite fast even for larger "
"molecules."
msgstr ""
"如果对所有贡献都使用有效的 Fock 矩阵，并且没有自旋-轨道积分被预先计算并存储在磁盘上（即，未给出 ``LSINT`` 命令），则 Fock "
"矩阵将以直接模式计算，且没有积分存储在磁盘上。当这与单中心近似（AMFI）结合使用时，计算和 I/O "
"时间会大幅减少，这使得即使对于较大的分子，自旋轨道计算也相当快速。"

msgid ""
"Also, the treatment of ECP-type of spin-orbit interaction has been changed "
"and now allows for treating both ECP and non-ECP atoms in one calculation. "
"Thus, in molecules containing both heavy and light atoms, the heavy atoms "
"can be described using ECPs and the light atoms using all-electron basis "
"sets. If the operator type is ``LS``, ``ALS``, ``FLS``, or ``AFLS``, then "
"for the atoms having an ECP spin-orbit operator defined in the basis input "
"the ECP operator is used, while the full BP-operator is used for all other "
"atoms (couplings are neglected). Both one-center and AMFI approximations can"
" be used in this case. If, on the other hand, one specifies the operator "
"type as ``ECPLS``, then the behavior is the same as in the previous "
"versions, i.e., only the ECP contributions are considered and the "
"contributions from all other atoms are neglected."
msgstr ""
"此外，ECP 型自旋-轨道相互作用的处理方式已经改变，现在允许在一次计算中同时处理 ECP 和非 ECP "
"原子。因此，在同时包含重原子和轻原子的分子中，重原子可以使用 ECP 描述，而轻原子可以使用全电子基组描述。如果算符类型是 ``LS``\\ 、\\ "
"``ALS``\\ 、\\ ``FLS`` 或 ``AFLS``\\ ，那么对于在基组输入中定义了 ECP 自旋-轨道算符的原子，将使用 ECP "
"算符，而对于所有其他原子，则使用完整的 BP 算符（耦合被忽略）。在这种情况下，单中心和 AMFI 近似都可以使用。另一方面，如果将算符类型指定为 "
"``ECPLS``\\ ，则行为与先前版本相同，即仅考虑 ECP 贡献，而忽略所有其他原子的贡献。"

msgid "Calculation and diagonalization of the entire SO-matrix"
msgstr "整个 SO 矩阵的计算与对角化"

msgid ""
"Computes the entire SO matrix and diagonalizes it using all states which are"
" contained in the records *record1, record2, record3, …*. All records must "
"have been generated using the ``SAVE`` directive of the of the MULTI or MRCI"
" programs. *type* may be either ``LS`` for Breit-Pauli calculations, or "
"``ECP`` for ECP-LS calculations. By default, the eigenvalues and dipole "
"transition matrix elements between the ground and excited states are "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"计算整个自旋轨道矩阵并利用记录 *record1, record2, record3, …* 中包含的所有态进行对角化。所有记录必须已使用 MULTI "
"或 MRCI 程序的 ``SAVE`` 指令生成。\\ *type* 可以是 ``LS``\\ （用于 Breit-Pauli 计算）或 "
"``ECP``\\ （用于 ECP-LS 计算）。默认情况下，会打印本征值以及基态与激发态之间的偶极跃迁矩阵元。"

msgid ""
"As with the ``TRANLS`` card, the ``HLSMAT`` is recognized only by the MRCI "
"program and must be preceded by a ``CI`` card (this is no longer necessary "
"with molpro2021.3 or later). Also, the ``OCC`` and ``CLOSED`` cards must be "
"the same for all states used in a ``HLSMAT`` calculation."
msgstr ""
"与 ``TRANLS`` 卡片类似，\\ ``HLSMAT`` 仅被 MRCI 程序识别，并且前面必须有一个 ``CI`` 卡片（在 "
"molpro2021.3 或更高版本中不再需要此要求）。此外，对于在 ``HLSMAT`` 计算中使用的所有态，\\ ``OCC`` 和 "
"``CLOSED`` 卡片必须相同。"

msgid "Modifying the unperturbed energies"
msgstr "修改未微扰能量"

msgid ""
"Often it may be sufficient to compute the spin-orbit matrix elements in a "
"smaller basis or at a lower computational level than the energies. It is "
"therefore possible to replace the energy eigenvalues by precomputed values, "
"which are passed to the spin-orbit program by the ``MOLPRO`` variable "
"``HLSDIAG``. The energy values in ``HLSDIAG`` must be in exactly the same "
"order as the states in the records given on the ``HLSMAT`` card. Before any "
"spin-orbit calculation, the variable ``HLSDIAG`` must either be undefined or"
" cleared (then the original energies are used), or must contain exactly the "
"number of energies as the number of states treated in the subsequent spin-"
"orbit calculation (use ``CLEAR,HLSDIAG`` to clear any previous values in the"
" variable). It is the user’s responsibility that the order of the energies "
"in ``HLSDIAG`` is correct!"
msgstr ""
"通常，在比能量计算更小的基组或更低的计算级别上计算自旋轨道矩阵元可能就足够了。因此，可以用预先计算的值替换能量本征值，这些值通过 ``MOLPRO`` "
"变量 ``HLSDIAG`` 传递给自旋轨道程序。\\ ``HLSDIAG`` 中的能量值必须与 ``HLSMAT`` "
"卡片上给出的记录中的态的顺序完全相同。在进行任何自旋轨道计算之前，变量 ``HLSDIAG`` "
"必须要么未定义或已清除（此时使用原始能量），要么必须包含与后续自旋轨道计算中处理的态的数量完全相同的能量数量（使用 ``CLEAR,HLSDIAG`` "
"清除变量中任何先前的值）。用户有责任确保 ``HLSDIAG`` 中能量的顺序是正确的！"

msgid ""
"See example in section `SO calculation for the S-atom using the BP operator "
"<spin-orbit-coupling.html#so-calculation-for-the-s-atom-using-the-bp-"
"operator>`__"
msgstr ""
"参见章节 `使用 BP 算子的 S 原子 SO 计算 <spin-orbit-coupling.html#so-calculation-for-the-"
"s-atom-using-the-bp-operator>`__ 中的示例"

msgid "Print Options for spin-orbit calculations"
msgstr "自旋轨道计算的打印选项"

msgid "where option can be"
msgstr "其中 option 可以是"

msgid "Options for spin-orbit calculations"
msgstr "自旋轨道计算选项"

msgid "Some options can be set using the ``OPTION`` directive (in any order)"
msgstr "部分选项可以使用\\ ``OPTION``\\ 指令设置（顺序任意）"

msgid ""
"``WIGNER`` This option determines whether the Wigner-Eckart theorem should "
"be used when the SO matrix is determined. ``WIGNER=1`` (default) uses the "
"theorem, ``WIGNER=0`` calculates each SO matrix element individually. This "
"option is needed for test purposes only."
msgstr ""
"``WIGNER`` 此选项决定确定SO矩阵时是否应使用Wigner-Eckart定理。\\ ``WIGNER=1``\\ （默认）使用该定理，\\ "
"``WIGNER=0``\\ 则单独计算每个SO矩阵元。此选项仅用于测试目的。"

msgid ""
"``HLSTRANS`` This option determines whether a SO matrix calculation should "
"be performed in the not spin-symmetry adapted basis set (``HLSTRANS=0``), in"
" the spin-symmetry adapted basis set (``HLSTRANS=1``, default) or with both "
"basis sets (``HLSTRANS=2``). At present, symmetry adaption can only be "
"performed for triplet states, where the following notation is used to "
"indicate the symmetry adapted spin functions: :math:`|S,M_S\\rangle_+ = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (|S,M_S\\rangle + |S,-M_S\\rangle)`, "
":math:`|S,M_S\\rangle_- = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (|S,M_S\\rangle - "
"|S,-M_S\\rangle)`. If only singlet and triplet states are considered, the "
"spin-orbit matrix is blocked according to double-group symmetry and the "
"eigenvalues for each each block are printed separately. In all other cases "
"the ``HLSTRANS`` option is ignored."
msgstr ""
"``HLSTRANS`` 此选项决定SO矩阵计算应在非自旋对称性适应的基组（\\ ``HLSTRANS=0``\\ ）、自旋对称性适应的基组（\\ "
"``HLSTRANS=1``\\ ，默认）中执行，还是在两种基组中执行（\\ ``HLSTRANS=2``\\ "
"）。目前，对称性适应仅能对三重态执行，其中使用以下符号表示对称性适应的自旋函数：\\ :math:`|S,M_S\\rangle_+ = "
"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (|S,M_S\\rangle + |S,-M_S\\rangle)`, "
":math:`|S,M_S\\rangle_- = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} (|S,M_S\\rangle - "
"|S,-M_S\\rangle)`\\ 。如果仅考虑单重态和三重态，自旋轨道矩阵会根据双群对称性分块，并分别打印每个块的特征值。在所有其他情况下，\\ "
"``HLSTRANS``\\ 选项将被忽略。"

msgid ""
"``MATEL`` If the entire SO matrix is calculated using ``HLSMAT``, the "
"individual matrix elements are normally not shown. When the option "
"``MATEL=1`` is given, the individual matrix elements and the contributions "
"of the internal and external configuration classes are printed."
msgstr ""
"``MATEL`` 如果使用\\ ``HLSMAT``\\ 计算整个SO矩阵，通常不会显示各个矩阵元。当给出选项\\ ``MATEL=1``\\ "
"时，会打印各个矩阵元以及内禀和外禀组态类的贡献。"

msgid "Data dump"
msgstr "数据转储"

msgid ""
"The data from the SO-CI calculation (SO-CI matrix, property matrices, "
"energies, etc.) can be exported (dumped) to a file (for external post-"
"processing)."
msgstr "来自SO-CI计算的数据（SO-CI矩阵、性质矩阵、能量等）可以导出（转储）到文件中（供外部后处理使用）。"

msgid "where format is one of"
msgstr "其中 format 是以下之一"

msgid ""
"``HDF5`` - Exports the data into a HDF5 file. Note: This is **only supported"
" if Molpro has been compiled with enabled HDF5 support** (by default support"
" is disabled!)"
msgstr ""
"``HDF5`` - 将数据导出到HDF5文件中。注意：\\ **仅当Molpro在编译时启用了HDF5支持时才支持此功能**\\ "
"（默认情况下支持是禁用的！）"

msgid "and file is the name of the file the data will be written to."
msgstr "而 file 是数据将被写入的文件名。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "SO calculation for the S-atom using the BP operator"
msgstr "使用BP算子的S原子SO计算"

msgid "SO calculation for the I-atom using ECPs"
msgstr "使用ECP对I原子进行SO计算"

msgid ""
"``LSINT [,X] [,Y] [,Z] [,ONECENTER] [;TWOINT,twoint;] [;PREFAC,prefac;]\\\\``"
" ``X``, ``Y``, and ``Z`` specify the components to be computed. If none of "
"these is given, all three are evaluated. The advantage of precomputing the "
"integrals is that they can then be used in any number of subsequent SO "
"calculations, but this may require a large amount of disk space (note that "
"there are 6 times as many integrals as in an energy calculation). If the "
"``LSINT`` card is not given, the integrals are computed whenever needed. The"
" keyword ``ONECENTER`` activates the one-center approximation for one- and "
"two- electron spin-orbit integrals. This can reduce drastically the "
"computing time for large molecules. ``TWOINT`` and ``PREFAC`` can be used to"
" control the accuracy of spin-orbit integrals. These thresholds are similar "
"to ``TWOINT`` and ``PREFAC`` for standard integrals. The default value for "
"``PREFAC`` is ``TWOINT/100``, and the default value for ``TWOINT`` is "
":math:`10^{-7}`. In the case when no integrals are precomputed, these "
"thresholds can be specified as options for ``HLSMAT`` or ``TRANLS`` cards, "
"see below."
msgstr ""
"``LSINT [,X] [,Y] [,Z] [,ONECENTER] [;TWOINT,twoint;] "
"[;PREFAC,prefac;]\\\\`` ``X``\\ 、\\ ``Y`` 和 ``Z`` "
"指定要计算的组分。如果这些都没有给出，则计算所有三个组分。预先计算积分的优势在于，它们随后可以用于任意数量的后续 SO "
"计算中，但这可能需要大量磁盘空间（注意积分数量是能量计算中的 6 倍）。如果未给出 ``LSINT`` 卡片，则在需要时计算积分。关键字 "
"``ONECENTER`` 激活单中心和双电子自旋-轨道积分的单中心近似。这可以大幅减少大分子的计算时间。\\ ``TWOINT`` 和 "
"``PREFAC`` 可用于控制自旋-轨道积分的精度。这些阈值类似于标准积分的 ``TWOINT`` 和 ``PREFAC``\\ 。\\ "
"``PREFAC`` 的默认值为 ``TWOINT/100``\\ ，\\ ``TWOINT`` 的默认值为 :math:`10^{-7}`\\ "
"。在没有预计算积分的情况下，这些阈值可以作为 ``HLSMAT`` 或 ``TRANLS`` 卡片的选项指定，见下文。"

msgid ""
"The input for spin-orbit ECPs is described in section :doc:`effective core "
"potentials <effective_core_potentials>`. Of course, in ECP-LS calculations "
"the ``LSINT`` card is not needed."
msgstr ""
"自旋-轨道 ECP 的输入在 :doc:`有效芯势 <effective_core_potentials>` 一节中描述。当然，在 ECP-LS "
"计算中不需要 ``LSINT`` 卡片。"

msgid "``TRANLS,record1.file, record2.file, bra2ms, ket2ms, lsop;``"
msgstr "``TRANLS,record1.file, record2.file, bra2ms, ket2ms, lsop;``"

msgid "***record1.file*** Record holding the bra-wavefunction."
msgstr "***record1.file*** 保存左矢波函数的记录。"

msgid ""
"***record2.file*** Record holding the ket-wavefunction. Both records must "
"have been generated using the ``SAVE`` directive of the MRCI program."
msgstr "***record2.file*** 保存右矢波函数的记录。两个记录都必须使用 MRCI 程序的 ``SAVE`` 指令生成。"

msgid "***bra2ms*** :math:`2 \\times M_S` value of the bra-wavefunction."
msgstr "***bra2ms*** 左矢波函数的 :math:`2 \\times M_S` 值。"

msgid "***ket2ms*** :math:`2 \\times M_S` value of the ket-wavefunction."
msgstr "***ket2ms*** 右矢波函数的 :math:`2 \\times M_S` 值。"

msgid "***lsop*** Cartesian component of the Spin-orbit Hamiltonian."
msgstr "***lsop*** 自旋-轨道哈密顿量的笛卡尔分量。"

msgid ""
"This can be one of :math:`{\\tt LSX}`, :math:`{\\tt LSY}`, or :math:`{\\tt "
"LSZ}` in all electron calculations, and :math:`{\\tt ECPLSX}`, :math:`{\\tt "
"ECPLSY}`, or :math:`{\\tt ECPLSZ}` in ECP calculations. Starting from the "
"``MOLPRO`` version 2008.1, more types are available which control the "
"approximation level. These are described in section `approximations used in "
"calculating spin-orbit integrals and matrix elements <spin-orbit-"
"coupling.html#approximations-used-in-calculating-spin-orbit-integrals-and-"
"matrix-elements>`__."
msgstr ""
"在全电子计算中，这可以是 :math:`{\\tt LSX}`\\ 、\\ :math:`{\\tt LSY}` 或 :math:`{\\tt "
"LSZ}` 之一，在 ECP 计算中可以是 :math:`{\\tt ECPLSX}`\\ 、\\ :math:`{\\tt ECPLSY}` 或 "
":math:`{\\tt ECPLSZ}` 之一。从 ``MOLPRO`` 2008.1 版本开始，有更多类型可用于控制近似级别。这些在 `计算自旋-"
"轨道积分和矩阵元时使用的近似 <spin-orbit-coupling.html#approximations-used-in-calculating-"
"spin-orbit-integrals-and-matrix-elements>`__ 一节中描述。"

msgid "``HLSMAT,type, record1, record2, record3, …``"
msgstr "``HLSMAT,type, record1, record2, record3, …``"

msgid "``PRINT,option$_1$=value$_1$, option$_2$=value$_2, \\ldots$``"
msgstr "``PRINT,option$_1$=value$_1$, option$_2$=value$_2, \\ldots$``"

msgid ""
"``HLS`` ``HLS=-1`` only the SO energies and transition matrix elements "
"between ground and excited states are printed (default)."
msgstr "``HLS`` ``HLS=-1`` 仅打印基态和激发态之间的 SO 能量和跃迁矩阵元（默认）。"

msgid ""
"``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 0`: The SO matrix is printed. ``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge "
"1`: The property matrices are printed. ``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 2`: The "
"individual matrix elements are printed (same as ``OPTION,MATEL``). ``HLS``\\"
" :math:`\\ge 3`: Debugging information is printed."
msgstr ""
"``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 0`\\ ：打印 SO 矩阵。\\ ``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 1`\\ "
"：打印性质矩阵。\\ ``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 2`\\ ：打印各个矩阵元（与 ``OPTION,MATEL`` 相同）。\\ "
"``HLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 3`\\ ：打印调试信息。"

msgid "``VLS`` ``VLS=-1``: No print of eigenvectors (default)."
msgstr "``VLS`` ``VLS=-1``\\ ：不打印本征向量（默认）。"

msgid "``VLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 0`: The eigenvectors are printed."
msgstr "``VLS``\\ :math:`\\ge 0`\\ ：打印本征向量。"

msgid "``OPTIONS  [,WIGNER=value] [,HLSTRANS=value] [,MATEL=value] \\\\`` where"
msgstr "``OPTIONS [,WIGNER=value] [,HLSTRANS=value] [,MATEL=value] \\\\`` 其中"

